# User Docs SoT

Files under [`docs/`](../../docs/) are **user-facing reference docs**. Roles:

| File | Role |
| ---- | ---- |
| `cli-reference.md` | Flag encyclopedia, pipeline internals, progress/TTY, **canonical exit codes** |
| `recipes.md` | Cookbooks / copy-paste workflows |
| `methodology.md` | Why NCLOC / indentation |
| `warning-codes.md` | Warning code catalog |

**Ownership:** [DOC-OWNERSHIP.md](../../.specs/codebase/DOC-OWNERSHIP.md).

## Forbidden

- Milestone tags: `\bM\d+\b`
- Changelog / provenance voice (“shipped in M…”)

## Allowed

- Present-tense encyclopedias and cookbooks
- Exit-code table in `cli-reference.md` (SoT)
- Links to README (adoption), ARCHITECTURE, CONTRIBUTING

## Sync rule

1. New power-user flag detail → `cli-reference.md`; essential first-run → README + one cli-reference entry.
2. Workflows → `recipes.md`; codes → `warning-codes.md`.

Editorial lint: [living-sot-doc.mjs](../hooks/lib/living-sot-doc.mjs) `lintDocsUserDoc`.
